# W11r, host a (k10): hosts Dry Land and goes on to stag0202 (Grief Wasteland, matz00), where it stays until b came back
# there by the lobby's return mat and joined it. (It heals from the L panel at 350 HP on the way, as W31's walks do.)
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@60
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log a hosts Dry Land
explore matz00 yes until stage=stag0202,control or hp<=350 fail epoch>=@500
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=900
explore matz00 yes until stage=stag0202,control or hp<=350 fail epoch>=@500
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=900
explore matz00 yes until stage=stag0202,control fail epoch>=@500
log a in stag0202
idle until present=2,sealed>=300 fail epoch>=@1200
log b joined a
idle until frames>=300
